# HTTP examples for module 19-native-performance. Run them from IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code (REST Client).
# Start the lesson first: ./mvnw -pl modules/19-native-performance/lesson spring-boot:run
# The native image answers the same requests (docker run ... -p 8080:8080, see README).

### 3.2 A derived query (AOT repository)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?title=java

### 3.2 A declared @Query (AOT repository)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/since/2017

### 3.4 Reflection: the configured price format
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/9780134685991/price

### 3.4 A resource: quote of the day
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quote

### 3.1 Unknown book → 404 ProblemDetail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/0000000000000
